  "clips": [
    {
      "kind": "recording",
      "in": 0.0,
      "out": 3.04,
      "scene": "hook",
      "text": "Once you see it, you can't unsee it.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 3.04,
      "end": 3.15
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "scene": "hook",
      "text": "I'm tired of being told I'm jealous whenever I question Argentina. I don't buy football's perfect Messi story.",
      "start": 3.15,
      "speech_end": 10.744666666666667,
      "end": 10.854666666666667
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "scene": "draw",
      "text": "FIFA separated Spain and Argentina until the final, if both won their groups. France and England got protection too. To me, that's protecting the product.",
      "start": 10.854666666666667,
      "speech_end": 21.445333333333334,
      "end": 21.555333333333333
    },
    {
      "kind": "recording",
      "in": 36.16,
      "out": 38.0,
      "scene": "draw",
      "text": "Again, very, very convenient.",
      "start": 21.555333333333333,
      "speech_end": 23.395333333333333,
      "end": 23.505333333333333
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 3,
      "scene": "egypt",
      "text": "Then Egypt: Ziko's breakaway goal was wiped out for Attia's earlier foul on Martinez. Egypt's coach, Hossam Hassan, called the officiating unjust.",
      "start": 23.505333333333333,
      "speech_end": 34.083333333333336,
      "end": 34.193333333333335
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 4,
      "scene": "salah",
      "text": "Argentina's winner followed the disputed challenge on Salah. FIFA says the officials checked it and judged normal contact. I still want those standards explained side by side.",
      "start": 34.193333333333335,
      "speech_end": 46.002,
      "end": 46.112
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 5,
      "scene": "austria",
      "text": "Against Austria, Rangnick disputed Mac Allister's challenge before Messi's opener. Schmeichel also said the goal should not have stood. That's criticism worth examining.",
      "start": 46.112,
      "speech_end": 56.788666666666664,
      "end": 56.898666666666664
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 6,
      "scene": "check",
      "text": "No trip to the monitor doesn't mean no check. Every goal is checked. The question is whether the same threshold was applied.",
      "start": 56.898666666666664,
      "speech_end": 64.346,
      "end": 64.456
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 7,
      "scene": "evidence",
      "text": "Messi as Maradona's heir. Ronaldo crashing the coronation. That's how I see this rivalry: greatness fighting a story people already wanted to finish.",
      "start": 64.456,
      "speech_end": 74.51333333333334,
      "end": 74.62333333333333
    },
    {
      "kind": "synthetic",
      "paragraph": 8,
      "scene": "close",
      "text": "I don't have to swallow every call just because the ending sells. Show the full build-ups. Explain the threshold. Same standard, both shirts. No superstar exemptions.",
      "start": 74.62333333333333,
      "speech_end": 85.794,
      "end": 86.4
    }
  ],
